'''Midsummer Rabbit''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Gals of Summer Sunshine (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Sunshine]] gacha event. She was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]], and is an [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]]/[[:Category:Anti-Angel Cats|Angel]] variant of [[The White Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|The White Rabbit]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] regains Slow and grants the [[Knockback|Knockback]] ability along with [[Immune to Waves|Immunity to Waves]].

