==Trivia==
*Midsummer Rabbit's Japanese description originally said 100% rather than 必ず (''kanarazu'', guaranteed) prior to [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]].
*Prior to [[Version 13.5 Update|Version 13.5]], she could be obtained from the [[Gals of Summer (Removed Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer]] gacha event.
*Before [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] she was obtainable from the [[Gals of Summer Blue Ocean (Gacha Event)|Gals of Summer Blue Ocean]] gacha event.
*At just over 9 years, Midsummer Rabbit holds the record for the second longest delay between a unit's initial release and the release of their [[True Form]], only beaten by [[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|Li'l Gau]] with its 9 years and 9 month-long delay.

